      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 11,
          "section": null,
          "quote": "Hence, the obstacles against dislocations mobility increase and despite the larger grain size, the hardness in this area is enhanced. It can be concluded that the dominant mechanism on micro-hardness variations of different zones relates to morphology and distribution of HfO 2 precipitates.",
